  "changes": "Exact source attribute/index buffer views and source node transforms retained for shaft, foot, collars and attached niche relief. Runtime adds reference09-controlled square hollow chamber, four-corner cap, mullions, real moss and rooted substrate. Source07 six-sided roof/chamber/lotus receiver excluded.",
  "maps": "Existing declared Scene09 CC0 Granite Tile04 RGB/normal/roughness files unchanged, sampled in metres.",
  "referenceUse": "Reference09 is comparison-only; no reference RGB, image displacement, depth card or replacement frame.",
  "visualAccepted": false,
  "runtimeDerivativeEdits": "Shaft/niche geometry scaled XZ0.90 and Y1.60; foot XZ0.80. New world-metric granite UVs and material age colours. Small closed mineral grains are area-weighted samples of the actual shaft/roof surfaces, with deterministic3D patch grouping. R02 triangle-shaped cladding was rejected and removed after native close inspection. New square chamber shortened after R01 native comparison. Two primary lamps use new heads; secondary lanterns retain historical assemblies.",
  "substrate": "Two nearby flat green procedural mounds replaced by existing declared CC0 textured rock geometry, raycast-seated fern roots and solid angular detritus. Original terrain/bank/stair/camera modules unchanged. Two local shrub crowns are opened slightly to expose the physical pedestal/rock contacts; the old global random-draw schedule and protected module sources remain unchanged."
}
